'''Mega Menace''' (ギガガガ強襲, ''Gigagaga Kyōshū'', '''Gigagaga's Assault''') was an event added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Mega Menace would reset when the event ended, allowing the player to collect the rewards again once the event returned. The boss of this Gauntlet was [[Mega-Mooth]], a variant of [[Mooth]] with more knockbacks and long-reaching Omni Strikes. As of [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]], this event was replaced with the [[Mega Menace|new version]] with 20 levels.

==Overview==
===About===
Mega Menace contained a total of 60 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''On Mighty Wings Lvs''', spread across 3 different maps: '''Mega Menace!''' (On Mighty Wings Lv1~20), '''Mega Menace!!''' (On Mighty Wings Lv21~40) and '''Mega Menace!!!''' (On Mighty Wings Lv41~60). After beating an On Mighty Wings Lv, players had to wait for 30 minutes before they could proceed to the next one. Rewards for the first completion of an On Mighty Wings Lv could include [[Battle Items]], [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. Every 20 On Mighty Wings Lvs played out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Mega Menace (Old)/On Mighty Wings Lv1~20]], [[Mega Menace (Old)/On Mighty Wings Lv21~40]] and [[Mega Menace (Old)/On Mighty Wings Lv41~60]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Mega Menace! was unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.
*Mega Menace!! was unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 and appeared 2 days into the event.
*Mega Menace!!! was unlocked after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1 and appeared 4 days into the event.

